    "data": {
      "id": 650,
      "hub_id": 886,
      "guid": "com.alexkarpen.hephaestus",
      "name": "Hephaestus",
      "slug": "hephaestus",
      "teaser": "It creates a trader that sells your preset weapon builds.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/886.jpg",
      "downloads": 96436,
      "favourites_count": 39,
      "description": "<h1>SPT4+ Important Note</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>⚠️ <strong>WARNING</strong>: If you use ANY other mod that adds weapons, attachments or any profile interaction that is saved under Hephaestus trader, and these mods don’t use static/stable mongo IDs between versions, <strong>you will get crashes</strong>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>Example:</strong> If you have another mod with a custom suppressor with <code>_id: 12345</code> and you use it as a custom weapon build, then the suppressor mod gets updated and the <code>_id</code> becomes <code>78854</code> — everything will crash. You have to clear the defective item from your profile.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>💡 <strong>Note:</strong> Hephaestus works ONLY with static/stable mongo IDs.  Which means they dont change when the mod author updates their mod.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr />\n<h2>Compatibility</h2>\n<p>🔴 <strong>The C# version is only compatible with 4.0.3+</strong> (you will get errors with previous versions)</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Configuration</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>📢 Due to public “outrage” (one singular individual told me so), I’ve noticed that the presets are cheap and who even uses euros lol.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3><strong>NEWSFLASH: There is a config file for price adjustment and currency selection!</strong></h3>\n<hr />\n<h2>External JSON Files</h2>\n<p>✅ You can add external JSON files now:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Copy the desired <code>userbuilds.weaponBuilds</code> to an independent <code>.json</code> file</li>\n<li>Put the file in the <code>presets</code> directory</li>\n<li>The file format should match the expected structure</li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<p>📝 You can have multiple files, and each file can contain multiple presets.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr />\n<h2>Troubleshooting</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Issue</th>\n<th>Solution</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>🔸 Don’t want additional presets</td>\n<td>Delete all contents of the <code>presets</code> directory</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>🔸 Trader is empty</td>\n<td>Make sure your profile has weapon presets OR you have external files</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>🔸 Doesn’t show latest weapon changes</td>\n<td>Click the <strong>Refresh Store</strong> button next to trader thumbnail</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr />\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<p>Follow the standard installation guide as instructed.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>💡 If you have many traders, you may need the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1508-kaeno-traderscrolling/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Trader Scroller from KAENO</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr />\n<h2>License</h2>\n<p><strong>YOU ARE FREE TO COPY IT AND RE-RELEASE IT AS YOU PLEASE WITHOUT NOTIFYING ME.</strong></p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>🙏 Thank you <strong>kikirio</strong> for the <code>staticRouterModService</code> code part!</li>\n<li>🙏 Thank you everyone who donates their free time for us!</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2>Support</h2>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/alexkarpen42040\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/generated/zfskfgqnf/rest-64ae61205597dc0aae32bda91d1b2e7f-yactzyp0.jpg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" /></a></p>\n",
